  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Demon Immortal Qi Jue stretches out two fingers as he points at Demon Judgment Board. He names upper-lower breathless qi. Demon Judgment Board erupts with a loud sound and stays stationary in midair. The immortal essence the Gu Immortals inside try to instill becomes choppy. This rank eight Immortal Gu House is like a dying old man who cannot take proper breaths.",
